WEBVTT

00:14:56.662 --> 00:15:00.246
Given that, what are some of
your favorite practices

00:15:00.246 --> 00:15:04.246
for questioning your own assumptions
and for rethinking yourself?

00:15:04.954 --> 00:15:09.162
I think the first one for me is just
the basic idea of thinking like

00:15:09.162 --> 00:15:11.746
a scientist to say that, you know,

00:15:11.829 --> 00:15:17.537
what scientists do is instead of forming
beliefs, they actually form hypotheses.

00:15:18.162 --> 00:15:22.996
And so instead of having an opinion
that set in stone, that means, OK,

00:15:22.996 --> 00:15:25.037
this is a hunch, how would
I go and tested?

00:15:25.954 --> 00:15:30.037
And, you know, I don't think that we have
to always operate like we're in a lab.